WEBVTT

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:17.590
I know this cold voice

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:22.020
Taking my friend

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:26.800
Maybe a little afraid you'll run away

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.700
But right now...

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:34.720
For this moment in time, I want to hold you tight

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.580
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:44.060
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:48.470
I'll take off and break all the way

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.420
For this moment in time, I just wanna be with you

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:57.940
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:02.250
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:06.750
I know I can change all the way

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:11.830
For the moment...

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:21.320
I just wanna hold you...

00:01:30.920 --> 00:01:35.880
"Moonlight Medium"

00:01:49.910 --> 00:01:51.940
Prince Izmal, where are you going?

00:01:52.050 --> 00:01:56.050
I'm tired of this party. Eugene left, too.

00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:58.500
But... the guests are still...

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:01.140
You go ahead and entertain them.

00:02:08.120 --> 00:02:12.710
Look... the moon is so beautiful. Such lovely silver light...

00:02:13.170 --> 00:02:15.610
It's just like your hair, Eugene.

00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:20.710
Thanks. 
By the way, Princess Najayra...

00:02:21.830 --> 00:02:25.680
would you mind telling me why you called me here?

00:02:25.860 --> 00:02:28.080
I just wanted to get a look at you in person.

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:34.790
All of you who surround Kajika Burnsworth have been investigated.

00:02:35.740 --> 00:02:38.910
Lee-Leng Huang... you...

00:02:39.900 --> 00:02:42.240
Perhaps Rumaty counts as one of you, too...

00:02:42.910 --> 00:02:45.950
The boy seems awfully taken with Kajika.

00:02:47.070 --> 00:02:49.600
The men from before... they were Americans, right?

00:02:50.420 --> 00:02:52.400
What do they have to do with Your Highness?

00:02:52.950 --> 00:02:55.910
They're dogs -- dogs after scraps.

00:02:56.800 --> 00:03:01.670
I don't mind dogs... obedient ones, at least.

00:03:02.060 --> 00:03:04.840
Izmal, for example. He's a good dog.

00:03:05.480 --> 00:03:07.090
That's quite a thing to say.

00:03:08.010 --> 00:03:10.120
Whatever you call it, a dog is a dog.

00:03:11.170 --> 00:03:14.280
Lately, though, I've grown a bit tired of dogs.

00:03:15.070 --> 00:03:18.750
Around Kajika, there are a lot of wilder beasts.

00:03:20.160 --> 00:03:21.570
This is an interesting discussion, but...

00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:25.500
that's not what I was asking about.

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:32.230
Let's change topics.

00:03:33.190 --> 00:03:37.580
What does Your Highness think of this coup d'état business?

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:41.000
As part of the royal family, you surely can't ignore it.

00:03:43.670 --> 00:03:46.010
What a dull question!

00:03:46.750 --> 00:03:48.990
I don't care what happens to the crown.

00:03:49.530 --> 00:03:51.680
Whichever fool wants it can have it.

00:03:54.210 --> 00:03:57.230
Somand... Izmal... Rumaty...

00:03:57.690 --> 00:04:00.090
Whoever makes things interesting will suit me.

00:04:00.750 --> 00:04:05.000
As long as they let me enjoy myself... I couldn't care less.

00:04:07.460 --> 00:04:10.320
I hear Kajika calls you "Mustafa?"

00:04:11.990 --> 00:04:16.300
She really thinks the spirit of her dead pet leopard is in you...

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:19.280
she's a little fool, but I think we'd get along...

00:04:20.730 --> 00:04:24.320
I'm quite pleased with you myself... Mustafa.

00:04:28.270 --> 00:04:30.570
Say, Mustafa, tell me...

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:35.690
just how many women have you watched kill themselves because of you?

00:04:37.260 --> 00:04:42.130
How did they do it? With a gun? With a knife?

00:04:42.620 --> 00:04:44.610
Was there blood? How much?

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:51.110
Do you even know what you're saying?

00:04:54.700 --> 00:04:56.060
Don't you dare!

00:04:56.930 --> 00:04:58.340
I won't have you talk like that!

00:04:59.330 --> 00:05:01.760
Are you trying to curse me with the spirit of those evil words?

00:05:02.520 --> 00:05:03.430
What kind of girl is this?

00:05:04.680 --> 00:05:08.740
What on earth is this force that can come from such a small frame?

00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:15.490
This girl...
She's a wild animal herself!

00:05:27.040 --> 00:05:27.990
Noei...

00:05:32.940 --> 00:05:36.260
Sezun continues to deny any knowledge of it...

00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:42.860
but a man of Noei's description was seen using a forged passport to leave for Malaysia.

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:48.140
Planning to go to Prince Somand...

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:51.170
he's so rash and so serious; it can't end well.

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:54.400
It seems I underestimated his capacity for action.

00:05:55.470 --> 00:05:58.520
He's a soldier to the core...

00:05:58.850 --> 00:06:01.070
he'll know how to stay well hidden in that region.

00:06:03.760 --> 00:06:06.620
Pursue him anyway.
I'm worried about Quinza's leanings.

00:06:07.670 --> 00:06:12.540
If Noei makes it into Raginei, the two of them are certain to meet.

00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:17.180
Do you think Quinza has gone over to the side of Prince Somand?

00:06:18.650 --> 00:06:22.120
I wouldn't say that.
But I think we can say for certain...

00:06:22.710 --> 00:06:25.340
if this royal family discord is a plot...

00:06:26.180 --> 00:06:27.320
he's the author.

00:06:29.500 --> 00:06:32.000
Please, don't give us all that strict stuff!

00:06:32.750 --> 00:06:36.620
If you have business with the Ambassador, please go to the embassy tomorrow morning.

00:06:37.280 --> 00:06:39.560
It can't wait until tomorrow!

00:06:39.980 --> 00:06:41.140
We're not suspicious characters.

00:06:41.990 --> 00:06:44.470
Look, here's my father's business card.

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:48.590
I don't care if you're the President; I can't let you pass.

00:06:50.330 --> 00:06:51.470
Of all the stubborn...

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:56.230
Miss Kajika, please, leave it to me.
I'm used to this kind of thing.

00:06:56.810 --> 00:06:57.580
Toranosuke!

00:06:58.800 --> 00:07:01.970
All we need is one word...

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:03.480
Here...

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:07.350
Idiots!

00:07:07.540 --> 00:07:09.650
Children like you, trying to bribe me?

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:11.560
I screwed up!

00:07:11.810 --> 00:07:13.900
I really am just a baby-face!

00:07:14.230 --> 00:07:18.120
What's this "used to this kind of thing?"
Forget it!

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:22.100
Aah!

00:07:22.610 --> 00:07:25.060
We'll force our way in! Keep up, Toranosuke!

00:07:25.390 --> 00:07:26.610
Hey, wait!

00:07:26.610 --> 00:07:29.120
Miss Kajika, this is nuts!

00:07:30.400 --> 00:07:34.400
Intruders! Seize them!
They came in the front gate!

00:07:35.080 --> 00:07:36.990
Ambassador, please give us an audience!

00:07:38.040 --> 00:07:39.180
What the heck are you doing?

00:07:39.890 --> 00:07:41.090
It's urgent!

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:46.410
It's dangerous, Ambassador!

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:49.950
Jim!

00:07:50.880 --> 00:07:54.050
I thought I might be seeing you soon... Kajika.

00:07:56.540 --> 00:07:58.030
Jim Simensky.

00:07:58.830 --> 00:08:00.800
He's an old friend of Dad's.

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:06.250
Harry told me you were coming to Raginei.

00:08:06.580 --> 00:08:09.560
In that case, he could have said something to me.

00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:13.970
I hear Harry is sheltering Prince Rumaty.

00:08:14.550 --> 00:08:16.290
Rumaty is innocent.

00:08:16.520 --> 00:08:20.060
Something is definitely going on inside the Raginei Royal Palace!

00:08:21.030 --> 00:08:28.300
So my friend Eugene was going to sneak into Prince Izmal's party to gather information, but...

00:08:28.760 --> 00:08:29.980
I'm worried...

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:34.890
He went to Prince Izmal's estate?
That's not good.

00:08:36.630 --> 00:08:40.060
It seems Prince Izmal is growing closer to the Rosenthal family.

00:08:41.140 --> 00:08:44.470
-Rosenthal?
-That's an American conglomerate.

00:08:45.610 --> 00:08:51.000
There is a connection between Harry and Nelson, the current Rosenthal chairman.

00:08:53.650 --> 00:09:00.710
Until about 20 years ago, the Burnsworth Group was only an independent oil company.

00:09:02.910 --> 00:09:09.720
Rosenthal, on the other hand, was known as part of Big Oil, and it controlled most of the world's multinationals.

00:09:10.670 --> 00:09:18.210
That is, until something sparked a reversal of their positions, and Rosenthal swiftly declined.

00:09:19.020 --> 00:09:23.100
Ever since, Nelson has called Burnsworth his enemy.

00:09:24.650 --> 00:09:30.280
His son and heir, Carl Rosenthal, is in Raginei now.

00:09:30.630 --> 00:09:32.460
Carl Rosenthal?

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:36.330
He's still a youngster, only around 20...

00:09:37.010 --> 00:09:39.750
but he's old Nelson's right-hand man.

00:09:41.220 --> 00:09:46.640
As soon as I heard he was here, I knew Rosenthal was up to something serious.

00:09:47.700 --> 00:09:50.740
The royal infighting won't end anytime soon.

00:09:51.510 --> 00:09:56.660
So Rosenthal has a grudge against Burnsworth and backs Prince Izmal...

00:09:57.840 --> 00:10:01.800
and now, because Eugene is Baron Volkan's son...

00:10:01.840 --> 00:10:05.240
he may have walked into the lion's den.

00:10:05.240 --> 00:10:10.330
Well, Baron Volkan has a great deal of political influence in France.

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:15.550
The other side is probably not foolish enough to provoke an international incident with France.

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:21.510
At any rate, we'll give it one night.

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:24.580
If he doesn't come back, I'll do something.

00:10:25.740 --> 00:10:26.920
Thank you, Jim.

00:10:33.530 --> 00:10:35.060
Carl Rosenthal...

00:10:36.840 --> 00:10:38.870
Would you tell me your name?

00:10:39.920 --> 00:10:42.020
I'm Carl Rosenthal.

00:10:43.090 --> 00:10:45.890
Carl... what a nice name.

00:10:46.510 --> 00:10:49.800
I'm Kajika. Kajika Burnsworth.

00:10:51.770 --> 00:10:53.030
...Burnsworth?

00:10:54.270 --> 00:10:56.470
Someday you will see my gratitude.

00:10:58.850 --> 00:11:02.020
To think, Carl's father has a grudge against Dad...

00:11:02.950 --> 00:11:05.440
It's okay, Eugene will be fine.

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:09.830
That's good, but...
I can't help thinking...

00:11:11.130 --> 00:11:14.590
Just like with Rumaty, even though he adores his brother Somand...

00:11:16.160 --> 00:11:19.120
People's hearts are... complicated.

00:11:20.890 --> 00:11:23.400
It's very... painful.

00:11:27.860 --> 00:11:30.660
Did you just say...

00:11:31.240 --> 00:11:33.430
you want to go outside, Prince?

00:11:33.990 --> 00:11:36.020
I did, and I won't ask again!

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:40.020
You put yourself in this position, Your Highness.

00:11:40.230 --> 00:11:42.820
I get it! I'm saying I get it!

00:11:43.770 --> 00:11:48.590
Just how long do I have to stay hidden in this house?

00:11:49.090 --> 00:11:50.790
It's for your safety.

00:11:51.200 --> 00:11:55.260
Even so, you could give me the least bit of breathing room!

00:11:56.090 --> 00:11:57.620
I understand your feelings, but...

00:11:58.490 --> 00:12:02.300
as long as you're in my custody, I can't permit it.

00:12:03.210 --> 00:12:06.510
Custody? Who said anything about custody?

00:12:07.000 --> 00:12:09.320
I have no guardian, and no country!

00:12:12.450 --> 00:12:14.330
I'm afraid you don't understand.

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:18.520
To put it harshly...

00:12:18.850 --> 00:12:22.760
You have only one protector: Harry Burnsworth.

00:12:24.770 --> 00:12:27.570
You're not going anywhere he doesn't want you to go.

00:12:28.580 --> 00:12:33.320
Why is Burnsworth sheltering me?
What's in it for him?

00:12:33.960 --> 00:12:37.670
That, Prince, is a question for you to answer.

00:12:39.310 --> 00:12:41.050
If you don't understand that...

00:12:41.050 --> 00:12:43.200
you're not trying hard enough.

00:12:44.510 --> 00:12:46.060
I...

00:12:48.190 --> 00:12:50.160
I hate you, Lee-Leng!

00:12:50.630 --> 00:12:52.790
That's your prerogative.

00:13:02.020 --> 00:13:05.110
You could have explained that a little more smoothly.

00:13:05.570 --> 00:13:08.110
Why speak so harshly to him?

00:13:09.000 --> 00:13:10.310
Why?

00:13:10.740 --> 00:13:13.350
If the Prince is going to be taken seriously...

00:13:13.950 --> 00:13:16.060
he should see what serious business looks like.

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:18.110
I'm not sure I follow you.

00:13:18.690 --> 00:13:21.180
Prince Rumaty is not Miss Kajika.

00:13:22.010 --> 00:13:26.250
When you scold him like that...
it doesn't seem likely that he'll just listen obediently.

00:13:27.080 --> 00:13:30.170
How did Kajika get into this?

00:13:30.790 --> 00:13:32.320
Never mind that.

00:13:33.020 --> 00:13:36.750
I understand your desire to train Prince Rumaty, but it's too much, too fast.

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:41.060
Before now, he's always been spoiled to his heart's content.

00:13:42.120 --> 00:13:45.800
The way he's carrying on now is just his way of venting his emotions.

00:13:46.690 --> 00:13:49.470
It won't get him anything he wants...

00:13:49.740 --> 00:13:52.060
and he knows it.

00:13:57.920 --> 00:14:01.060
He has grown up under his own restraint...

00:14:02.410 --> 00:14:04.560
But from now, even that much won't be permitted.

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:09.930
He'll have no freedom until he wears the crown...

00:14:11.250 --> 00:14:16.020
and then if he gets the crown, there's another set of restraints waiting for him.

00:14:16.760 --> 00:14:19.040
He must be made to remember that.

00:14:19.890 --> 00:14:25.500
Master Lee-Leng...
do you believe Prince Rumaty will gain the throne?

00:14:25.890 --> 00:14:28.090
Nothing is settled yet...

00:14:29.000 --> 00:14:31.050
but something is going to happen in Raginei.

00:14:31.730 --> 00:14:36.500
And whatever storm comes...
Prince Rumaty will be caught in it.

00:14:39.690 --> 00:14:44.260
That's his fate.
There's no escaping it.

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:52.190
I can't stand it anymore!
Where does he get off, bossing me around?

00:14:52.670 --> 00:14:55.030
Y--your Highness, please try to calm down...

00:14:55.030 --> 00:14:59.500
Where!? He's just one of Burnsworth's pawns!

00:14:59.710 --> 00:15:02.170
If Your Highness could be patient...

00:15:02.440 --> 00:15:06.460
Sezun! I'm going outside!
If I can't leave, I'll die!

00:15:06.850 --> 00:15:07.930
Your Highness...

00:15:08.140 --> 00:15:13.480
I'll just die.
That's what my brother wants anyway...

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:16.440
My brother...

00:15:18.120 --> 00:15:19.110
Your Highness...

00:15:21.040 --> 00:15:21.990
Leave.

00:15:22.780 --> 00:15:23.960
I said go!

00:15:24.560 --> 00:15:25.960
Don't let anyone in!

00:15:26.960 --> 00:15:27.960
Get out!

00:15:40.570 --> 00:15:44.650
My brother... to be treated so badly...

00:15:45.390 --> 00:15:47.460
this is how much he hates me.

00:16:02.600 --> 00:16:06.640
When we were children, we often played together...

00:16:07.820 --> 00:16:11.130
But then, once I reached 10 years old...

00:16:11.240 --> 00:16:14.450
I could no longer come to the Crown Prince whenever I liked...

00:16:15.730 --> 00:16:18.010
and my big brother changed.

00:16:19.870 --> 00:16:25.690
The Crown Prince's Chamberlain, Kanan, and First Chamberlain Sareha...

00:16:25.840 --> 00:16:28.090
they shut him up and kept me away from him.

00:16:31.030 --> 00:16:34.280
All of this... this must be their doing!

00:16:35.260 --> 00:16:38.800
That's it... my brother is just being manipulated!

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:46.150
That has to be it!
My brother could never decide anything by himself.

00:16:47.770 --> 00:16:50.310
If they did this, it's unforgivable.

00:16:50.960 --> 00:16:52.820
They should be ripped from limb to limb!

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:58.310
I have to go back... whatever it takes.

00:17:00.650 --> 00:17:04.330
But how...?
How can I get out of here?

00:17:05.200 --> 00:17:07.870
How do I catch Lee-Leng Huang off guard?

00:17:12.330 --> 00:17:16.320
I'll have to play a role.
Pretend to accept my fate quietly...

00:17:16.320 --> 00:17:19.040
and act the part of the powerless child.

00:17:19.390 --> 00:17:21.330
It's my only chance.

00:17:21.710 --> 00:17:25.350
Then I'll escape back to my country...find my brother, and find out for sure!

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:28.950
Until I hear it with my own ears...

00:17:30.240 --> 00:17:31.360
I won't believe it!

00:17:52.910 --> 00:17:55.150
A little bird told me...

00:17:56.560 --> 00:18:00.290
Princess Najayra is meeting with Eugene De Volkan.

00:18:01.320 --> 00:18:05.530
Three people that I know of have gone into that room and never came out...

00:18:09.320 --> 00:18:10.370
It's late...

00:18:11.260 --> 00:18:14.260
-What are they doing?
-Is everything alright?

00:18:14.260 --> 00:18:16.940
The young master doesn't think much of Princess Najayra.

00:18:17.180 --> 00:18:20.020
He'll negotiate with Prince Izmal to the bitter end...

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:23.340
Prince Izmal is just a yes-man for Miss Najayra.

00:18:24.470 --> 00:18:26.650
He's useless without her.

00:18:27.270 --> 00:18:28.260
Gregory!

00:18:29.650 --> 00:18:30.730
The young master!

00:18:32.240 --> 00:18:33.810
Carl... what is it?

00:18:34.580 --> 00:18:38.800
I hear Eugene De Volkan is here.
Is he in there?

00:18:39.160 --> 00:18:41.680
Miss Najayra said she wanted to meet him...

00:18:42.490 --> 00:18:43.790
Idiotic.

00:18:44.170 --> 00:18:45.820
--I'm going in.
--But...

00:18:45.970 --> 00:18:48.680
Miss Najayra said not to let anyone in...

00:18:49.820 --> 00:18:54.270
Gregory...
When did you become Najayra's chamberlain?

00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:56.780
It's not like that!

00:18:56.780 --> 00:19:02.040
I just meant... putting her in a bad mood doesn't help Rosenthal any.

00:19:02.520 --> 00:19:08.330
All the more reason.
We're careful, and she's off guard.

00:19:10.760 --> 00:19:15.890
Miss Najayra! It's Carl!
May I come in?

00:19:17.180 --> 00:19:21.010
If you don't reply, I'll just come in... alright?

00:19:22.520 --> 00:19:23.640
Yes, sir...

00:19:34.530 --> 00:19:36.480
Eugene De Volkan?

00:19:38.320 --> 00:19:39.750
And you are?

00:19:41.670 --> 00:19:43.660
Carl Rosenthal.

00:19:44.100 --> 00:19:46.040
Forgive my rudeness.

00:19:46.560 --> 00:19:47.990
Rosenthal?

00:19:51.800 --> 00:19:55.510
-...did the Princess flee?
-It seems she dislikes you.

00:19:56.380 --> 00:19:59.340
Hates me... is more like it....

00:20:00.770 --> 00:20:03.600
because her magical powers don't work on me.

00:20:04.000 --> 00:20:04.830
Magical powers?

00:20:05.990 --> 00:20:11.270
Her grandmother's family was responsible for the magical portion of the royal family.

00:20:14.000 --> 00:20:19.610
It was also their duty to interpret God's messages for the King...
and to tell the future.

00:20:22.780 --> 00:20:27.320
To this day, they're a very powerful house, even apart from the royal family.

00:20:27.980 --> 00:20:32.840
I see.
That explains her confidence, then.

00:20:33.280 --> 00:20:35.990
Well, that's not all.

00:20:36.300 --> 00:20:39.950
As a medium, she carries her own religious power.

00:20:41.460 --> 00:20:43.800
At any rate, it's almost sunrise.

00:20:44.650 --> 00:20:46.260
I'll get you back to a hotel.

00:20:46.740 --> 00:20:48.980
No thanks, I have a car.

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:52.250
Voilà! Car keys.

00:20:53.490 --> 00:20:54.240
Eddie...

00:20:54.420 --> 00:20:56.450
I'll be driving you back to the hotel.

00:20:58.320 --> 00:21:00.370
Aw, don't look like that...

00:21:00.530 --> 00:21:04.690
I'm the one who told Carl.
How about a "thank you?"

00:21:11.780 --> 00:21:12.850
Volkan...

00:21:13.640 --> 00:21:17.260
Give Kajika a message for me.
Tell her the debt is repaid.

00:21:20.330 --> 00:21:22.150
Well, night.

00:21:26.150 --> 00:21:28.030
A debt... to Kajika?

00:21:32.530 --> 00:21:35.140
Young master... I was looking for you.

00:21:35.180 --> 00:21:37.190
Ah, Harris. Sorry about that.

00:21:37.190 --> 00:21:39.900
We've confirmed the whereabouts of Prince Rumaty.

00:21:43.500 --> 00:21:45.410
Then he was at the Burnsworth estate.

00:21:49.220 --> 00:21:52.630
Chairman Harry may claim not to know, but it's over.

00:21:53.230 --> 00:21:55.990
-Inform Somand.
-Yes, sir.

00:21:56.180 --> 00:21:58.640
Do you wish to send assassins?

00:21:59.700 --> 00:22:03.670
Not this time.
Somand's chamberlains have a plan.

00:22:04.500 --> 00:22:06.340
They'll bring him here and then execute him.

00:22:07.170 --> 00:22:09.490
Well... even just bringing him back...

00:22:09.570 --> 00:22:12.990
unless he makes a move on his own, we can't get our hands on him.

00:22:13.840 --> 00:22:18.910
We'll just have to hope Rumaty does something reckless.

00:22:20.590 --> 00:22:25.580
Given his personality...
there's a pretty good chance.

00:22:27.470 --> 00:22:29.060
The more the two of them fight, the better.

00:22:29.870 --> 00:22:33.310
It makes them look bad in front of their people and the world.

00:22:34.050 --> 00:22:37.920
Is that where the pure Prince Izmal comes in?

00:22:40.140 --> 00:22:41.920
A little weak, isn't he...

00:22:44.200 --> 00:22:49.370
But, then, what we really want...
is a king who can't manage to do good or evil.

00:22:50.530 --> 00:22:55.100
But a smart king or a queen who's evil itself...
we don't need.

00:23:01.780 --> 00:23:08.380
I can't stand feeling this distance,

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:16.210
So I'm starting to search for your heart.

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:22.790
Because you were always at my side, protecting me.

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:28.020
And I'm afraid of being alone.

00:23:30.240 --> 00:23:37.280
Though it's been a long time, everyone's just the same.

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:44.720
Whether sleeping now, or crying, I want to see your smiling face.

00:23:44.720 --> 00:23:52.240
Because I will love you, with heart overflowing.

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:59.330
Don't turn away, look at me. I believe in you.

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:06.860
So, no one else knows our secret thoughts

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:14.240
The blue sea of a strong and beautiful time.

00:24:14.590 --> 00:24:24.380
In those arms, in that embrace, I'm alive.
